* =============================================================================
* AutoAnalog — Two-Stage CMOS Op-Amp Subcircuit  (Rev 2 — Verified)
* =============================================================================
* Verified operating point (ngspice, TSMC-180nm-class model, T=27C, VBIAS=0.57V):
*   DC Gain      = 61.9 dB
*   GBW          = 15.6 MHz  [TARGET: 10 MHz  OK]
*   Phase Margin = 72.9°     [TARGET: 60 deg  OK]
*   VOUT1        = 1.078V
